WEBVTT

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.840
Are you okay, White?

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.800
What's going on?

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.630
Where are we?

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.840
Where's Ilkubo?

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:42.890
A world where darkness 
is holy... Dotsuku Zone.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.270
I am the ruler of Dotsuku Zone...

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:50.860
Jyaku-King!

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.060
So that's...

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.790
Jyaku-King?

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.800
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.640
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:06.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:09.880
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.750
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:18.560
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:25.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:28.070
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:31.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.840
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.410
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:41.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:44.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:50.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:51.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:54.330
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:57.130
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.030
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:16.970
So that's...

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:18.930
Jyaku-King?

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.160
That's right.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:24.260
And this is your grave.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:52.450
Pretty Cure... I will bury 
you in front of Jyaku-King.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:05.230
"GOODBYE MEPPLE AND MIPPLE?!
 NO WAY!"

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:25.920
It's no use.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.350
It had no effect at all.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.180
He didn't even budge.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:34.330
His power has increased with the help 
of Jyaku-King's power of darkness mepo.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.790
It's impossible to fight 
against him here mipo.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:40.910
This is a world where darkness rules.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:45.330
There's no way you can win 
using the power of light.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.650
It can't be...!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.810
I won't allow it!

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.620
I won't allow it...!

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.350
White!

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:22.460
It's getting dark popo.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:25.100
The power of darkness is getting stronger.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.920
Queen... What should we do?

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.670
White!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.190
How dare you...!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:12.450
It can't be!

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.530
I didn't affect him at all!

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:20.930
Black!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.730
White!

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:26.200
Black! Pull yourself together mepo!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:29.670
I'll finish you off.

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:51.590
You're kidding!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.060
This is the final blow!

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:58.190
Disappear, and die!

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:13.670
Jyaku-King, Sir...

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.080
Pretty Cure...

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.820
Pretty Cure...

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:28.590
Jyaku-King, Sir!

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.260
Why?

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.790
Wasn't he one of you?

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:48.210
I had to protect the Prism Stones from him.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.470
You mean you got rid of 
one of your own people

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:57.070
just so you could protect the Prism Stones?

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:59.630
That's a good enough reason for me.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.310
I don't believe it!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.530
You really are a lowlife!

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:09.160
Pretty Cure... What is darkness to you?

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:12.180
What is darkness anyway?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:19.620
I don't know, but I won't forgive you.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:27.200
The sky... The sky is pitch black.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.520
What kind of weather is this anyway?

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:32.600
Mom! The sky looks strange.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:35.500
Does it? Maybe it's going to rain.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.470
But, it's strange...

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:41.590
There isn't a cloud in the sky.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:49.940
Total silence... Total 
void... Total darkness...

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.180
Darkness is everything in this world.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:58.890
The Field of Light and Field of 
Rainbows will be destroyed someday.

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:01.340
What will be left in the end is...

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:02.890
Darkness.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:06.450
Darkness will turn everything 
back into nothing...

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:09.650
No matter how hard you fight, it's useless.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:14.370
Everything will be destroyed and 
destined to turn unto darkness.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:18.900
It's better for you to sleep 
for eternity in darkness.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.010
Hey! Prism Stones!

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.550
Help me!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.800
Black!

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.130
Are you okay, Black?

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:00.690
Thank you!

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:03.080
Why do you fight?

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.560
Why do to such lengths to fight anyway?

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:12.330
It's obvious! For the sake of our friends.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.520
Friends?

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:17.500
If you destroy the Field of Light,
 it will make Mipple and Mepple sad.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:19.260
White...!

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:20.980
How foolish!

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:25.290
Is that the reason you're fighting?

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.680
That's enough for us!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.470
Someone like you who would abandon one of 
your own so easily can't understand that, can you?

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.620
Light will be destroyed.

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:38.110
The world will be swallowed up by darkness.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.460
That's fate.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:44.070
I don't care about darkness or fate!

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:47.930
We just want to protect what we care about.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.080
Even if the world of light 
will be destroyed someday,

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.390
that someday isn't now.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.370
We...

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.340
...won't lose!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.280
Black Thunder!

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:02.150
White Thunder!

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:11.480
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.330
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:19.120
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:49.220
It's useless!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.230
Our Marble Screw...

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:53.620
...disappeared!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:57.700
Light has no power in the 
presence of darkness.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.860
Queen!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.860
Why...? Why do you get up again?

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.040
We won't lose!

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:38.330
We won't lose to you!

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.730
Queen of Light...

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.640
Jyaku-King from the dark!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.260
Why did you come?

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:16.260
It's the power of Pretty Cure 
that has brought me here.

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:22.520
The strong, pure thoughts of those who are 
trying to protect what they care about.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:28.370
Do you know that if you destroy 
me, you will destroy yourself?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.930
You and I are two sides of the same coin...

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:34.680
If this is true, then it can't be helped.

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:38.780
You don't have the power to destroy darkness.

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:41.170
That may be true...

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:43.780
Even if I don't...

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:48.320
Don't tell me that those two have 
the power to destroy darkness...?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:52.840
Pretty Cure are legendary warriors 
who will bring salvation.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.820
You're out of your mind, Queen!

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:58.340
They have the power to save 
others and the heart to do it.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.280
They are the Field of Light's and my hope.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:07.630
Mepple! We're going to 
restore your homeland soon.

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.600
Black!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.280
Just wait, Mipple... I promise that we'll...

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:14.960
White...!

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.140
Black Thunder!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:24.600
White Thunder!

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:36.960
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:39.920
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:45.050
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:50.260
I told you that it was useless!

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:57.200
I will crush your hope!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:21.010
You can't...

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.760
...do this to me!

00:14:58.270 --> 00:14:59.740
Did we...

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:00.860
...do it?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.830
Did we defeat Jyaku-King?

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:24.470
Mom! The sun!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.590
You're right.

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:28.010
I wonder what that was.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:39.040
Power of Creation please 
appear before us now!

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:24.750
It's beautiful!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.350
What a wonderful sight!

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:29.210
This is the true Field of Light mepo.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:32.780
Thanks to the two of you, it's been 
restored to what it was before mipo.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:36.460
Thank you so much, Yoshiko-san and Keiko-san.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:38.870
It's Nagisa and Honoka mepo!

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.520
Well done popo!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:43.220
Who do you think you are mepo?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:49.350
Does this mean that our job is done?

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:52.050
What are you and Mepple 
going to do now, Mipple?

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:55.170
This is our hometown mipo.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:58.020
We're going to live here 
on the Field of Light mepo.

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:00.660
That's right... you are.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.750
I guess this means goodbye then.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:08.130
Come to think of it, wasn't 
one day in the Field of Light

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.970
equal to 100 years in the Field of Rainbows?

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:12.330
Does that mean when we go 
back we'll be old ladies?

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:18.160
No! I don't want that to happen!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:19.240
It's the opposite...

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:21.720
Everyone there will be old men and old women.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.380
Either way it's bad.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.220
Don't worry.

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:29.360
If you go back with Pollun, 
he'll adjust the time.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:31.840
Is that right?

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:35.270
We'll see you again, won't we?

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.940
Pollun... Take the two of them...

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.030
Okay popo.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:47.730
Pollun! Pollun! Pollun!

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.510
Mepple! Mipple!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.260
Come and visit us again.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.790
Honoka... Thank you for taking 
care of me up until now mipo.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:00.020
I'm glad I met you mipo.

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.790
Nagisa...

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:08.720
It's a real relief to me that I don't 
have to take care of you anymore, Mepple.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:13.070
I's a real relief to me that I won't have 
to see your pumpkin face anymore mepo!

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:17.020
Hurry! Let's go popo.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:19.980
Mipple!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.520
Honoka!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.300
Nagisa...

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:33.220
Honoka!

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:34.470
Nagisa!

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:37.000
Mepple!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.030
Mipple!

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:40.200
Honoka!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.400
Nagisa!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:02.990
They're gone.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.360
Chutaro...

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:13.980
It's really over, isn't it? Really over.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:16.910
This is for the best, isn't it?

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.640
We won't have to fight anymore.

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:23.290
It's for the best, isn't it?

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:29.860
Honoka...? Honoka!

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:33.710
Were you together, Nagisa?

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.030
Grandmother!

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:38.990
I must have nodded off... 
I didn't realize the time.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:42.020
I'll hurry and prepare dinner.

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:44.320
Would you like to join us, Nagisa?

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.680
Yes, I will. I'm starved.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.960
So am I.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:55.110
I guess I'll have to prepare a lot then.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.640
Good work.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:17.140
Nagisa! Take care of me mepo.

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:22.140
I wonder if Mepple is eating properly.

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.010
Nagisa!

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:43.540
Nagisa!

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:11.310
Nagisa!

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:13.670
Take care of me mepo!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:19.050
Mepple? What are you doing here?

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:21.990
I'm going to be living here again mepo.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.520
So be sure you take good care of me...

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:25.730
...mepo.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.750
Mepple...

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.260
Nagisa...?

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:37.460
Nagisa!

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.400
Mepple!

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.960
Nagisa!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.030
Mepple!

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:49.110
What do you mean... Take care of you?

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:50.720
Don't you have anything else to say to me?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:55.120
If I don't say it, you'll forget 
to take care of me mepo...

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.960
Why you...?

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:03.970
Nagisa!

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:08.550
Honoka!

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:12.660
Pollun!

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:15.480
There's another one now.

00:22:16.510 --> 00:22:17.430
Mepo!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:19.950
I guess it doesn't matter.

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:55.660
We were finally reunited, but

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:58.170
Mepple keeps pestering 
me with his "mepo mepo."

00:23:58.170 --> 00:23:59.200
Oh no!

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:00.420
I can't find Pollun anywhere!

00:24:00.420 --> 00:24:03.050
This is terrible! We'd 
better hurry, and find him.

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:05.300
What is this strange movement of clouds?

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:06.730
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:08.220
Are we going to have to fight again?

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:11.010
It can't be!

00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:16.270
"A NEW DARKNESS CLOSES IN! 
SAVE THE LOST POLLUN"

00:24:16.270 --> 00:24:17.910
Please be safe...

00:24:17.910 --> 00:24:19.750
We'll come, and save you.
